administered intravenously to subtotally nephrectomized (SNX) rats three times weekly for 2 weeks.                    
Results. Despite the suppression of PTH to comparable levels, the calcification of the hearts, aortas and kidneys in the
1,25(OH)2D3-treated group was significantly greater than in the OCT-treated gr
