28±4\u2009ml/min) and in the placebo group (by 26±5\u2009ml/min) (P<0.05), with no difference being detected between the
groups.                    Conclusions. Long-term treatment with alfacalcidol is safe and might be beneficial for the 
preservation of bone mass in the pre-dialysis stages of CRF, most likely through a reduction in bone turnover as 
